section repayment terms is:

the monthly interest rate is a number N if
    the interest rate per annum is a number M
    and N = M / 12.

the compound factor is a number if
    the monthly interest rate is a number N
    and a base B = 1 + N
    and the monthly installments is a third number
    and the base to the power of B with the third number is the number.

% RESIDUE r1 BEGIN: Monthly Installment Amount
% TODO: translate the fragment below by hand, or with the Contract Assistant (residue mode); it was not translated automatically
%   source: lines 65-75
% a value with no LE form: (`Money` WITH `Currency` IS (`Principal Amount`'s `Currency`), `Value` IS ((`Principal Amount`'s `Value`) TIMES ((`Monthly Interest Rate` TIMES `Compound Fac...
%   l4:
%   | `Monthly Installment Amount` MEANS                          -- Here we implement a basic Loan Amortization Formula or PMT
%   |     Money WITH
%   |         Currency  IS `Principal Amount`'s Currency          -- Installment Amount =
%   |         Value     IS `Principal Amount`'s Value             --    Principal * (Rate * Compound Factor) / (Compound Factor - 1)
%   |                         TIMES (`Monthly Interest Rate` TIMES `Compound Factor`)
%   |                             DIVIDED BY (`Compound Factor` MINUS 1)
%   |     WHERE
%   |         `Compound Factor` MEANS                             -- Compound Factor =
%   |             `Base to the power of`                          --    (1 + Rate) ^ Number of Installments
%   |                 (1 PLUS `Monthly Interest Rate`)
%   |                 `Monthly Installments`
% RESIDUE r1 END

the currency of total_repayment_amount is the currency of a value if
    the principal amount is the value.

the value of total_repayment_amount is a number N if
    the monthly installment amount is a value
    and the value of the value is a number M
    and the monthly installments is a number K
    and N = M * K.

the currency of total_interest_amount is the currency of a value if
    the principal amount is the value.

the value of total_interest_amount is a number N if
    the value of total_repayment_amount is a number M
    and the principal amount is a value
    and the value of the value is a number K
    and N = M - K.

